OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FAfter a cool start to the day,
OL,6,FFriday will bring plenty of dry
OL,7,Fweather with sunny spells and the odd
OL,8,Fshower towards the north and west.
OL,9,FWinds mainly light and feeling
OL,10,Fpleasant in the sunshine.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FIsolated showers will persist
OL,13,Fovernight, mainly towards the
OL,14,Fnorthwest. Remaining dry for most with
OL,15,Fclear spells, feeling fresh for all.
OL,16,
OL,17,CSaturday:FLight to moderate
OL,18,Fnorthwesterly winds will bring an
OL,19,Fisolated shower at times. Otherwise,
OL,20,Fdry with sunny spells and pleasantly
OL,21,Fwarm.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
